@startuml

' ===== 字体与样式设置 =====
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontName SimHei
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam participantPadding 20
skinparam sequenceBoxBackgroundColor #F8F8F8

' 黑白风格，确保打印清晰
skinparam monochrome true

' ===== 参与者（精简为6个） =====
actor "用户" as User
participant "古树检索界面" as SearchPage
participant "TreeRetrieveController" as Controller
participant "ITreeRetrieveService" as Service
participant "DHLAM模型" as DHLAM
participant "TreeRetrieveMapper" as Mapper
participant "MySQL数据库" as DB

' ===== 前置条件说明 =====
note over User, SearchPage
  <b>前置条件：</b>用户已完成登录
end note

' ===== 核心检索流程（三种模式合并描述） =====
autonumber 1
User -> SearchPage: 上传图像或输入坐标(lat,lon)
activate SearchPage

autonumber 2
SearchPage -> Controller: 调用 /tree/retrieve (POST)
activate Controller

autonumber 3
Controller -> Service: retrieve(query)
activate Service

autonumber 4
Service -> DHLAM: 调用模型服务生成哈希码
activate DHLAM

autonumber 5
DHLAM -> DHLAM: 特征提取(ResNet-50 / LocationEncoder)
DHLAM -> DHLAM: 多模态融合
DHLAM -> DHLAM: 哈希层生成128位哈希码(FC→Tanh→Sign)

autonumber 6
DHLAM --> Service: 返回哈希码
deactivate DHLAM

autonumber 7
Service -> Mapper: selectByHashCode(hash)
activate Mapper

autonumber 8
Mapper -> DB: 哈希码相似度查询
activate DB
DB --> Mapper: 返回匹配结果集
deactivate DB

autonumber 9
Mapper --> Service: 返回古树信息列表
deactivate Mapper

autonumber 10
Service -> Service: 汉明距离排序(Top-K)

autonumber 11
Service --> Controller: 返回检索结果
deactivate Service

autonumber 12
Controller --> SearchPage: 返回古树信息JSON
deactivate Controller

autonumber 13
SearchPage --> User: 渲染检索结果列表
deactivate SearchPage

' ===== 底部说明（替代右侧note，不占横向空间） =====
note over Controller, DB
  <b>三种检索模式共享同一流程</b>
  I2I: 图像→哈希码→相似图像
  I2L: 图像→哈希码→地理位置
  L2I: 坐标→哈希码→附近图像
end note

@enduml
